=documentation&amp;utm_medium=RSS&amp;utm_campaign=feed-syndication</link> <pubDate>Sat, 06 Jun 2026 05:49:33 +0000</pubDate> <source url="https://30daymapchallenge.com/feed_rss_created.xml">30DayMapChallenge</source><guid isPermaLink="true">https://30daymapchallenge.com/notes/</guid> </item> <item> <title>A few site updates</title> <description>&lt;h1&gt;A few site updates&lt;/h1&gt; &lt;p&gt;A short note to kick off this section. The site has had some housekeeping lately: the Mapping resources page is refreshed, and the map collections page has been tidied up to make it easier to browse and add your own.&lt;/p&gt; &lt;p&gt;This is also where notes like this will live from now on — occasional updates, the odd announcement, and roundups of maps from the community. Nothing on a fixed schedule.&lt;/p&gt; &lt;p&gt;If you&#39;d like to help organise the challenge, get in touch at &lt;a href=&#34;mailto:info@30daymapchallenge.com&#34;&gt;info@30daymapchallenge.com&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;</description> <link>https://30daymapchallenge.com/notes/2026/06/06/a-few-site-updates/?utm_source=documentation&amp;utm_medium=RSS&amp;utm_campaign=feed-syndication</link> <pubDate>Sat, 06 Jun 2026 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate> <source url="https://30daymapchallenge.com/feed_rss_created.xml">30DayMapChallenge</source><guid isPermaLink="true">https://30daymapchallenge.com/notes/2026/06/06/a-few-site-updates/</guid> </item> <item> <title>Map collections</title> <description>Browse community galleries, portfolios and write-ups of #30DayMapChallenge maps from 2019 onwards — and add your own collection so others can find it.</description> <link>https://30daymapchallenge.com/galleries/?utm_source=documentation&amp;utm_medium=RSS&amp;utm_campaign=feed-syndication</link> <pubDate>Tue, 19 May 2026 11:20:26 +0000</pubDate> <source url="https://30daymapchallenge.com/feed_rss_created.xml">30DayMapChallenge</source><guid isPermaLink="true">https://30daymapchallenge.com/galleries/</guid> </item> <item> <title